  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoons lard",
    "1.5 cups water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aP25XumYQQ9XyGuMO0PWl9v-aAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/157642-homemade-flour-tortillas-step1-4x3-0135064414802231-bd60dc5d9567467ca43ca7cf24091ccc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/157642/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, baking powder, and salt together in a mixing bowl; rub in lard with your fingers until mixture resembles cornmeal. Add water; mix until dough comes together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OMS2pF_KRL-MH4JqMbRytIuuzqw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/157642-homemade-flour-tortillas-step3-4x3-0135064414802233-fda885cb3d6e4fdcaccb51fc0b71ca76.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/157642/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer dough onto a lightly floured surface; knead for a few minutes until smooth and elastic. Divide dough into 24 equal pieces; roll each piece into a ball.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cGMKsWzhBV7CRyoIMc8Jb4qn12Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/157642-homemade-flour-tortillas-step6-4x3-0135064414802248-eb18ba1054ef4759ac524ef9be33b744.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/157642/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Roll 1 dough ball into a thin, round tortilla using a well-floured rolling pin. Place tortilla into the hot skillet; cook until bubbly and golden. Flip; continue cooking until golden on other side. Place cooked tortilla in a tortilla warmer; continue rolling and cooking with remaining dough balls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/R3pZYrnRnZF8cN3auNvSYWgvn6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/157642-homemade-flour-tortillas-step8-4x3-0135064414802259-d3e8b32893414c3d9cdd7bf1157f1d56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/157642/step_04.webp"
    },
